## Notes

* Every value is rendered as a string, because the API mixes strings and numbers in one response and a
  map attribute has a single element type. An empty string always means the run's underlying value was
  itself empty, not that the key is absent.
* The set of keys is whatever the run recorded, so it varies with how the run was triggered — a
  schedule-triggered run reports different `pipeline.trigger_parameters.*` keys than a push-triggered
  one.
